    "description": "Installable Candidate two-Spark native-vision profile for the official DeepSeek V4 Flash Vision Experimental checkpoint. It reproduces MiaAI-Lab c444d703 on the immutable Anemll ARM64 runtime, including current image routing, cache-layout, narrow-image, role-validation, and shared-memory recovery fixes, with OpenAI image_url input, the 32-layer ViT and aligner, FP4/FP8 weights, NVFP4 DS-MLA KV, DSpark K6, 1M context, and a measured 17.04 GiB / 2,331,430-token KV pool at 0.835 utilization; Vonk physical image and dual-Spark acceptance remain pending.",
